[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20522.69, "timestamp": "05:42:02", "text": "意思是？等等，我想知道。等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20531.71, "timestamp": "05:42:11", "text": "什么？她做了点点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20533.868, "timestamp": "05:42:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20536.708, "timestamp": "05:42:16", "text": "事物。我找不到那个。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20547.628, "timestamp": "05:42:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20550.47, "timestamp": "05:42:30", "text": "好的。等待。如果我太喜欢它，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20553.27, "timestamp": "05:42:33", "text": "或许我太难相处了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20556.548, "timestamp": "05:42:36", "text": "所以，试着打出一个好的“哦，不”。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20559.75, "timestamp": "05:42:39", "text": "为什么。好的。好的。好的。好的。好的。跑步"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20562.15, "timestamp": "05:42:42", "text": "我的演讲。好的。这就是原因。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20563.43, "timestamp": "05:42:43", "text": "好的。好的。好的。好的。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20564.68, "timestamp": "05:42:44", "text": "好的。 [音乐]"}]